WEBVTT

00:11.420 --> 00:13.350
<i>Mie-san sits next to me.</i>

00:13.350 --> 00:14.820
<i>She's my crush.</i>

00:16.410 --> 00:18.310
<i>She always wears glasses.</i>

00:18.310 --> 00:21.580
<i>Apparently, without them, she can hardly see.</i>

00:23.590 --> 00:25.080
<i>And Mie-san...</i>

00:25.340 --> 00:29.330
Mie-chan, could you give me extra stew?

00:30.400 --> 00:31.590
Just a little, then.

00:31.840 --> 00:33.670
Yay!

00:35.340 --> 00:37.340
<i>And Mie-san...</i>

00:38.810 --> 00:41.160
<i>forgot her glasses again today.</i>

00:39.860 --> 00:43.020
Huh, did you want more?

00:50.780 --> 00:51.860
The Girl I Like 
her Glasses

00:51.860 --> 00:54.870
The Girl I Like 
Forgot her Glasses

02:14.860 --> 02:18.910
Episode 2

02:14.860 --> 02:18.910
The Girl I Like Asked Me Out

02:15.210 --> 02:18.070
<i>Mie-san forgot her glasses again today.</i>

02:20.290 --> 02:24.120
<i>Actually, it's not so much 
that she forgot, as that...</i>

02:24.980 --> 02:28.570
Huh, did you forget your glasses again?

02:28.570 --> 02:29.410
No.

02:29.410 --> 02:32.290
I stepped on them and they broke.

02:33.790 --> 02:35.470
<i>Please, God!</i>

02:34.460 --> 02:39.050
<i>It's because I hoped she'd 
forget her glasses again!</i>

02:41.550 --> 02:43.940
Wait, wait, wait!

02:42.220 --> 02:45.400
<i>And she just happens to be on lunch duty.</i>

02:47.350 --> 02:48.880
<i>Which is why...</i>

02:50.280 --> 02:53.860
<i>I thought I'd support her again today.</i>

02:53.860 --> 02:53.990
<b>Overflowing</b>

02:53.990 --> 02:54.200
<b>Overflowing</b>

02:54.240 --> 02:54.490
<b>Overflowing</b>

02:54.490 --> 02:54.740
<b>Overflowing</b>

02:54.740 --> 02:54.860
<b>Overflowing</b>

02:54.860 --> 02:55.070
<b>Overflowing</b>

02:55.110 --> 02:55.360
<b>Overflowing</b>

02:55.360 --> 02:55.490
<b>Overflowing</b>

02:57.960 --> 03:01.530
M-Mie-san, should I take care of the stew?

03:02.240 --> 03:04.180
Nah, It's okay.

03:04.180 --> 03:07.290
I'm not going to get in 
the way of your koppe pan.

03:08.400 --> 03:10.510
I don't really know what you mean by that...

03:10.510 --> 03:12.670
But I can't help but worry.

03:12.670 --> 03:13.290
It's fine.

03:14.060 --> 03:15.290
I'll do it.

03:16.150 --> 03:19.300
In fact, I shall be glad to do it.

03:19.760 --> 03:23.300
<i>Where'd she pick up that warrior talk?</i>

03:23.830 --> 03:26.190
So I ended up covered in mud...

03:28.670 --> 03:30.130
<i>It's gotta be hard.</i>

03:30.130 --> 03:32.960
<i>I really wouldn't mind helping her.</i>

03:32.960 --> 03:34.810
<i>She's so tenacious.</i>

03:35.150 --> 03:38.140
<i>And so cute in her ponytail and chef uniform.</i>

03:39.670 --> 03:43.470
You might want to go a bit easy 
on the stew when you serve it.

03:43.470 --> 03:44.230
Ah.

03:46.070 --> 03:47.730
Going a bit easy.

03:48.570 --> 03:51.290
S-So little!

03:51.290 --> 03:53.040
<i>I saw that coming.</i>

03:55.560 --> 03:57.600
It's pretty hard.

03:57.600 --> 03:59.000
Are you sure you don't want to switch?

04:00.570 --> 04:01.520
Nah.

04:01.520 --> 04:02.810
I'm fine.

04:02.810 --> 04:06.690
Although it kinda sucks that 
I'm starting to get hungry.

04:08.120 --> 04:11.020
I can't wait to have stew.

04:12.870 --> 04:15.300
Mie-san, you like stew?

04:16.420 --> 04:17.400
Yeah.

04:17.400 --> 04:18.150
A lot.

04:18.980 --> 04:20.600
Yeah?

04:20.600 --> 04:22.690
Do you like stew?

04:24.740 --> 04:27.160
I actually prefer curry.

04:28.130 --> 04:29.550
I guess.

04:29.550 --> 04:31.320
It's okay.

04:31.320 --> 04:32.790
Mie-san, Mie-san!

04:33.700 --> 04:35.290
Could you give me extra meat?

04:35.290 --> 04:37.120
<i>H-H-How dare you!</i>

04:37.120 --> 04:39.620
<i>No difficult requests!</i>

04:40.060 --> 04:43.510
<i>You're going to burden Mie-san!</i>

04:46.000 --> 04:47.080
Huh?

04:47.080 --> 04:49.210
Umm...

04:49.580 --> 04:50.970
I'll do that next time.

04:50.970 --> 04:53.220
<i>What's wrong?</i>

04:53.220 --> 04:55.270
<i>I've never seen her so wishy-washy.</i>

04:56.650 --> 04:59.400
C-Could I give you lots of potatoes instead?

04:59.840 --> 05:01.940
<i>I feel like that's a hard ask.</i>

05:02.300 --> 05:03.840
Sure, that works.

05:03.840 --> 05:05.710
It does?!

05:05.710 --> 05:06.370
There.

05:06.370 --> 05:07.430
Potatoes.

05:09.240 --> 05:11.740
<i>Huh? Wait, that's a lot of meat!</i>

05:12.000 --> 05:14.710
You're such a nice person, Mie-san.

05:14.710 --> 05:16.750
Sorry it's just potatoes.

05:16.750 --> 05:18.750
<i>Potatoes and chicken...</i>

05:20.400 --> 05:22.760
<i>do have the same size and color...</i>

05:24.580 --> 05:26.430
<i>I can't blame her for getting them confused.</i>

05:31.390 --> 05:32.800
I can finally eat.

05:32.800 --> 05:34.770
I'm hungry, too.

05:35.030 --> 05:39.400
<i>I wonder if Mie-san was trying 
to keep some meat for herself.</i>

05:40.100 --> 05:42.760
<i>That'd be so cute.</i>

05:45.140 --> 05:46.940
Here, Komura-kun.

05:47.610 --> 05:48.850
Is that for me?

05:49.300 --> 05:50.160
Thanks.

05:51.640 --> 05:52.660
Also...

05:55.440 --> 05:58.900
I wanted to give you plenty of meat.

05:58.900 --> 06:00.110
So I kept some.

06:00.610 --> 06:04.110
It might not be enough to 
repay you for that other day,

06:04.110 --> 06:06.340
but I thought you might appreciate it.

06:15.280 --> 06:17.710
I thank you kindly for all your services.

06:17.710 --> 06:20.150
I shall return the favor someday.

06:21.240 --> 06:24.480
<i>Mie-san kept it for me?!</i>

06:25.620 --> 06:30.800
Stew's better with plenty of meat, so...

06:30.800 --> 06:32.990
Oh, so I didn't hear you earlier...

06:35.270 --> 06:37.830
Komura-kun, do you like stew?

06:41.340 --> 06:44.250
I-I love it.

06:46.890 --> 06:47.950
Great.

06:48.530 --> 06:50.760
Don't tell anyone, okay?

06:51.020 --> 06:51.710
Okay!

06:52.480 --> 06:53.200
Okay!

06:54.220 --> 06:56.770
<i>We all saw it, though...</i>

06:56.770 --> 06:57.420
Okay!

07:07.600 --> 07:10.210
<i>Yeesh, so much potato.</i>

07:20.510 --> 07:21.960
Morning!

07:26.500 --> 07:29.040
All right, today's the day!

07:29.040 --> 07:30.010
Yeah.

07:30.010 --> 07:31.510
<b>Class 2-B</b>

07:36.190 --> 07:37.080
Morning.

07:37.080 --> 07:38.960
You forgot your glasses, huh?

07:38.960 --> 07:39.700
Yeah.

07:42.880 --> 07:46.600
I went a whole week without forgetting.

07:46.600 --> 07:48.530
Not very long, huh?

07:48.890 --> 07:50.810
Oh, speaking of which...

07:55.890 --> 07:57.320
Contacts?

07:57.320 --> 07:59.160
I never took them out of my pouch.

08:00.600 --> 08:01.750
Though...

08:01.750 --> 08:04.460
<b>Roll, roll, roll, roll</b>

08:01.750 --> 08:04.460
<b>Roll, roll, roll, roll</b>

08:02.160 --> 08:04.460
I hate how they float around.

08:04.460 --> 08:08.750
And I'm traumatized by the 
time I couldn't get them out.

08:05.790 --> 08:06.760
<b>Hurk...</b>

08:06.760 --> 08:08.750
<b>Hurk... 
Urgh...</b>

08:09.200 --> 08:10.870
I see.

08:10.870 --> 08:13.520
I think I should get used to them, though.

08:13.520 --> 08:14.340
Huh?

08:14.910 --> 08:15.980
I'll try it.

08:15.980 --> 08:17.890
D-Don't force yourself.

08:27.290 --> 08:28.100
I can't!

08:28.100 --> 08:29.340
I'm getting teary.

08:29.340 --> 08:30.400
Mie-san!

08:31.520 --> 08:33.250
You don't need to wear contacts.

08:33.250 --> 08:34.400
Don't force yourself.

08:34.400 --> 08:35.680
But...

08:35.680 --> 08:37.880
I-I'll protect you.

08:39.590 --> 08:43.220
I'll protect you even if you don't 
have your glasses or contacts!

08:43.220 --> 08:44.210
Don't worry!

08:47.030 --> 08:49.240
That was weirdly intense.

08:55.440 --> 08:57.830
Thanks, Komura-kun.

08:58.220 --> 09:00.860
<i>Thanks, Komura-kun.</i>

09:01.070 --> 09:03.480
<i>Thanks, Komura-kun.</i>

09:03.660 --> 09:06.010
<i>Thanks, Komura-kun.</i>

09:06.170 --> 09:08.480
<i>Thanks, Komura-kun.</i>

09:09.150 --> 09:11.440
U-Use this.

09:11.440 --> 09:12.520
Thanks.

09:12.990 --> 09:15.820
<i>That made me want to protect her for life.</i>

09:28.900 --> 09:33.010
<i>She looks pouty even with her glasses.</i>

09:33.230 --> 09:35.920
<i>Wh-What's going on?</i>

09:35.920 --> 09:37.760
<i>This is a real mystery.</i>

09:38.490 --> 09:41.290
<i>Is she challenging me?</i>

09:41.780 --> 09:45.770
<i>Am I the one to solve the mystery of Mie-san?</i>

09:46.100 --> 09:47.730
Morning, Komura-kun.

09:48.140 --> 09:49.790
M-Morning.

09:49.790 --> 09:53.910
Why are you squinting even 
though you have your glasses?

09:55.440 --> 09:57.190
It's so stuffy outside.

09:57.190 --> 09:58.800
My glasses get foggy.

09:58.800 --> 10:01.160
<i>Th-That's a reason, too?</i>

10:01.430 --> 10:03.490
The weather's humid enough as it is.

10:03.490 --> 10:06.160
I wish it wouldn't mess with my glasses.

10:06.720 --> 10:09.670
I should be safe now, now that I'm in class.

10:09.670 --> 10:12.520
<i>She always makes it sound 
like something mighty.</i>

10:12.520 --> 10:15.330
<i>I guess there's a lot to deal with, though.</i>

10:17.550 --> 10:18.480
Morning.

10:17.550 --> 10:19.680
<i>Tokita-kun's all fogged up, too.</i>

10:18.590 --> 10:19.680
Morning.

10:20.600 --> 10:22.750
<i>It looks like stained glass.</i>

10:22.750 --> 10:24.020
Komura-kun...

10:30.680 --> 10:32.900
There's a stranger in our class!

10:33.720 --> 10:36.060
Should I tell the teacher?

10:36.060 --> 10:37.340
I-It's Tokita-kun!

10:37.340 --> 10:38.650
Our classmate!

10:38.650 --> 10:39.450
Eh?

10:42.250 --> 10:44.780
I couldn't tell, because 
I couldn't see his eyes.

10:44.780 --> 10:45.410
<i>Really?</i>

10:45.990 --> 10:50.360
I wonder if other people 
couldn't recognize me, either.

10:50.360 --> 10:51.420
Nah...

10:52.170 --> 10:54.350
I have a feeling you're good.

10:55.030 --> 10:56.420
Oh, well, I guess.

10:57.270 --> 11:00.180
As long as you recognize me, Komura-kun.

11:00.510 --> 11:03.360
<i>As long as you recognize me, Komura-kun.</i>

11:03.720 --> 11:06.600
<i>As long as you recognize me, Komura-kun.</i>

11:06.950 --> 11:09.810
<i>As long as you recognize me, Komura-kun.</i>

11:10.080 --> 11:13.000
<i>As long as you recognize me, Komura-kun.</i>

11:15.820 --> 11:16.440
Oh...

11:17.440 --> 11:19.580
Right, we're switching classrooms today.

11:20.800 --> 11:22.150
<i>W-Wait!</i>

11:22.150 --> 11:24.340
<i>I'm still savoring the moment!</i>

11:24.340 --> 11:26.620
<i>Don't stop me yet!</i>

11:31.020 --> 11:34.580
Komura-kun, could you tell me your LIME ID?

11:37.760 --> 11:40.160
I-I'll tell you as many times as you'd like.

11:40.160 --> 11:41.840
Once is fine.

11:43.120 --> 11:45.480
Like, why? Though?

11:45.480 --> 11:49.160
You know how I forget my glasses a lot?

11:50.620 --> 11:55.770
I might really have to ask 
for your help someday.

11:55.770 --> 11:57.980
<i>She's still intent on forgetting them.</i>

11:58.780 --> 12:01.070
A-Are you sure you want to ask me?

12:01.070 --> 12:02.740
Wouldn't you be better off asking 
your family or something?

12:02.740 --> 12:04.020
I couldn't tell them.

12:04.020 --> 12:07.120
It's embarrassing, forgetting your glasses.

12:07.120 --> 12:09.090
<i>She's embarrassed?</i>

12:09.090 --> 12:09.960
But...

12:11.090 --> 12:16.500
But I'm okay with you seeing 
me being embarrassing.

12:17.100 --> 12:20.510
<i>...I'm okay with you seeing 
me being embarrassing.</i>

12:20.890 --> 12:23.170
<i>...seeing me being embarrassing.</i>

12:23.280 --> 12:25.510
<i>...seeing me being embarrassing.</i>

12:26.530 --> 12:31.020
You've already seen me forgetting my 
glasses and being embarrassing, anyway.

12:31.600 --> 12:33.460
Sorry I have to depend on you.

12:37.190 --> 12:38.300
Komura-kun?

12:41.940 --> 12:43.870
Komura-kun, are you free?

12:41.940 --> 12:43.900
Komura-kun, are you free?

12:43.870 --> 12:46.950
Komura-kun, are you free?

12:43.900 --> 12:46.950
Could you come to Kichijoji Station?

12:43.900 --> 12:47.980
Could you come to Kichijoji Station?

12:50.720 --> 12:52.400
<i>Komura Kaede, 13 years old.</i>

12:52.400 --> 12:53.270
<i>Spring has come!</i>

12:53.790 --> 12:56.660
<i>I'd just friended Komura-san 
on LIME the other day.</i>

12:57.630 --> 13:00.340
<i>I never thought she'd ask me out.</i>

13:00.340 --> 13:03.300
<i>I was so surprised, I fell out of bed.</i>

13:08.560 --> 13:09.220
I'm here.

13:09.220 --> 13:09.710
Hey.

13:09.710 --> 13:10.310
Let's go.

13:10.520 --> 13:11.400
<i>Huh?</i>

13:15.220 --> 13:16.960
<i>This should be it.</i>

13:21.540 --> 13:23.220
<i>M-Mie-san!</i>

13:23.220 --> 13:24.750
<i>She forgot her glasses!</i>

13:26.420 --> 13:27.320
Komura-kun.

13:27.320 --> 13:28.690
Sorry for dragging you out.

13:28.690 --> 13:30.160
No, it's fine, but...

13:30.160 --> 13:31.910
You forgot your glasses?

13:31.910 --> 13:34.450
I fell asleep on the train.

13:37.250 --> 13:39.150
I got off in a panic, and...

13:44.120 --> 13:47.290
Like, I'd lost them.

13:49.680 --> 13:52.800
Maybe you aren't cut out for wearing glasses.

13:52.800 --> 13:56.960
However, there is somewhere I must be.

13:56.960 --> 13:58.600
I must ask you to take me there.

13:59.420 --> 14:02.460
<i>She talks like a samurai sometimes.</i>

14:02.970 --> 14:05.180
<i>Wait, does that mean...</i>

14:05.180 --> 14:07.710
<i>We're in town together on a weekend...</i>

14:10.640 --> 14:11.870
<i>It's practically a da—</i>

14:12.630 --> 14:14.620
<i>It's practically a da...</i>

14:15.280 --> 14:19.120
<i>No, I know it's nothing like 
that, but I'm so happy!</i>

14:19.120 --> 14:21.630
<i>I might die of happiness any day now.</i>

14:22.000 --> 14:24.800
I-If you're okay with me taking 
you there, I totally will.

14:27.800 --> 14:28.750
Thanks.

14:29.490 --> 14:30.890
Tug me there?

14:32.320 --> 14:33.360
<i>Thanks.</i>

14:33.920 --> 14:35.340
<i>Tug me there?</i>

14:37.730 --> 14:39.830
So, I'm trying to get to...

14:42.880 --> 14:44.060
Komura-kun?

14:44.060 --> 14:47.860
<i>My death couldn't have been 
more than a day or two away.</i>

14:51.480 --> 14:53.870
<i>Hang on, hang on...</i>

14:54.090 --> 14:55.980
<i>Am I supposed to be holding her hand still?</i>

14:56.710 --> 14:58.410
<i>Am I supposed to be holding her hand still?</i>

14:58.410 --> 14:59.650
<i>Really?</i>

15:02.370 --> 15:05.800
So, is this where you wanted to go?

15:07.780 --> 15:09.310
Enjoy your stay.

15:09.960 --> 15:11.960
This cake's only on sale on Saturdays.

15:11.960 --> 15:15.680
I was dead set on having it, 
and I just couldn't give up.

15:16.560 --> 15:18.210
<i>She likes cake.</i>

15:18.630 --> 15:19.680
<i>Cute.</i>

15:29.680 --> 15:33.010
<i>She's having trouble locating the cake.</i>

15:33.010 --> 15:34.310
It's so hard to eat.

15:38.300 --> 15:39.320
Err...

15:39.320 --> 15:40.120
What should I do?

15:40.600 --> 15:42.620
Should I feed you?

15:45.880 --> 15:47.350
S-Sorry!

15:47.350 --> 15:48.630
Never mind! My mistake.

15:48.630 --> 15:49.500
Forget I said that.

15:49.500 --> 15:50.880
I retract my statement and 
offer my deepest apolo—

15:55.220 --> 15:56.890
<i>This is wrong, right?</i>

15:57.530 --> 16:02.460
<i>Shouldn't I visit her home and 
receive her father's blessing first?</i>

16:03.400 --> 16:04.870
<i>No, wait!</i>

16:06.270 --> 16:09.950
<i>What's really wrong is for this to go on.</i>

16:17.580 --> 16:18.440
Yum.

16:18.440 --> 16:19.260
Thanks.

16:19.260 --> 16:21.020
Twelve bites to finish the whole thing.

16:21.620 --> 16:25.170
<i>I pictured her father in my mind and 
begged for his mercy twelve times.</i>

16:27.240 --> 16:31.420
Oh, is this the next place you wanted to go?

16:31.420 --> 16:34.470
Megane Eye-Eye

16:32.140 --> 16:33.330
The glasses shop?

16:33.330 --> 16:34.190
Yeah.

16:34.190 --> 16:35.970
My lenses don't match me anymore.

16:35.970 --> 16:38.680
Custom order frames

16:36.640 --> 16:38.680
So I ordered new ones.

16:39.550 --> 16:41.980
And they arrive today.

16:42.540 --> 16:44.530
<i>So this is her main destination.</i>

16:52.680 --> 16:54.360
I see all.

16:54.360 --> 16:56.220
<i>She sounds like a god.</i>

16:58.530 --> 17:01.790
<i>I guess that's it for me, then.</i>

17:03.210 --> 17:05.690
<i>I can't not wash my hands,</i>

17:06.450 --> 17:11.380
<i>but maybe I can swab the sebum 
off my hands and preserve it.</i>

17:12.070 --> 17:16.420
<i>When in love, the young male
can become quite repulsive.</i>

17:12.070 --> 17:16.890
When in love, the male 
young can become 
quite repulsive.

17:18.530 --> 17:20.170
Okay, well...

17:21.420 --> 17:23.030
Thanks for today.

17:23.430 --> 17:24.380
Thank you, too.

17:24.380 --> 17:25.520
See you.

17:32.750 --> 17:34.030
Are you in a hurry?

17:34.900 --> 17:36.700
N-Not at all.

17:36.700 --> 17:39.030
I'm totally free, in fact.

17:39.540 --> 17:42.730
I want to hang out a bit longer, then.

17:44.000 --> 17:47.430
Now that I can finally see you.

17:57.690 --> 17:59.600
Why are you looking away?

17:59.600 --> 18:00.920
Huh? Umm...

18:00.920 --> 18:02.600
Dunno.

18:04.850 --> 18:05.980
Can you get it?

18:05.980 --> 18:07.180
Let's try again.

18:11.450 --> 18:12.220
Yum.

18:12.220 --> 18:13.640
I've never tried this before.

18:13.640 --> 18:14.610
It's good, huh?

18:17.310 --> 18:18.960
Thanks for everything today.

18:18.960 --> 18:20.950
I had a lot of fun.

18:21.180 --> 18:22.900
No, me too.

18:22.900 --> 18:25.850
There are no earthly words to 
tell you how much fun I had.

18:25.850 --> 18:27.650
I'm glad to hear.

18:27.650 --> 18:29.780
Well, see you at school.

18:45.690 --> 18:47.750
<i>The whole day felt like a dream.</i>

18:49.000 --> 18:52.880
<i>But when I pinched my 
cheek, it definitely hurt.</i>

18:52.880 --> 18:54.360
<i>I'm not dreaming.</i>

18:54.860 --> 18:59.120
<i>I pinched the loose skin on my thigh 
and the cartilage of my ear...</i>

18:59.120 --> 19:00.700
<i>It actually hurt.</i>

19:01.750 --> 19:03.660
<i>I'm definitely not dreaming.</i>

19:11.120 --> 19:14.320
<i>Komura-kun's such a nice person.</i>

19:14.320 --> 19:18.270
<i>He didn't seem the slightest bit 
annoyed that I dragged him out.</i>

19:18.930 --> 19:22.020
<i>I can't thank him enough.</i>

19:24.620 --> 19:25.730
Almost!

19:25.730 --> 19:28.410
My new glasses work really well.

19:28.410 --> 19:29.020
Huh.

19:29.020 --> 19:32.010
<i>I think it was doubly fun.</i>

19:33.100 --> 19:33.820
<i>Huh?</i>

19:35.230 --> 19:40.180
<i>I feel like I was looking at 
Komura-kun the whole time.</i>

19:42.990 --> 19:44.390
<i>Must be my imagination.</i>

19:45.450 --> 19:46.540
Hot!

19:46.990 --> 19:48.080
I-It stings!

19:48.470 --> 19:53.080
I pinched my cheek and thigh
and ear too hard and it hurts!

20:03.090 --> 20:04.090
<b>Class 2-B</b>

20:10.100 --> 20:12.600
<i>That's Mie-san... right?</i>

20:12.810 --> 20:14.900
Wh-What's wrong, Mie-san?

20:14.900 --> 20:15.900
Are you okay?

20:15.900 --> 20:16.750
Sick?

20:17.170 --> 20:18.210
Yeah...

20:18.210 --> 20:19.680
I think I have a cold.

20:19.680 --> 20:22.830
I don't think it's too bad, 
though, so I'm okay.

20:24.580 --> 20:27.700
<i>Her glasses are completely 
fogged up by her breath.</i>

20:28.330 --> 20:32.710
<i>Though Mie-san's always cute, 
no matter what state she's in.</i>

20:33.120 --> 20:34.900
It's hard to see.

20:34.900 --> 20:36.330
Komura, over here.

20:37.920 --> 20:39.060
Yeah?

20:43.980 --> 20:46.040
Tokita, what the hell?

20:46.040 --> 20:48.520
Your glasses are fogged up. 
You look like a creeper.

20:48.520 --> 20:49.970
Shut up!

20:50.480 --> 20:51.520
I can't help it!

20:51.520 --> 20:52.760
Sorry, sorry.

20:52.760 --> 20:53.980
Are you sick?

20:54.310 --> 20:57.170
I can't help it. It's hilarious.

20:57.170 --> 20:58.990
Shut <i>up</i>!

21:02.740 --> 21:04.370
That's how we turned it around and won.

21:06.690 --> 21:09.640
<i>"Creeper? Hilarious! Hahaha!"</i>

21:19.060 --> 21:21.280
M-Mie-san, where's your glass?

21:21.280 --> 21:22.960
I-I forgot them.

21:22.960 --> 21:24.760
Huh? But you just...

21:25.000 --> 21:26.520
I forgot them.

21:26.520 --> 21:27.430
Eh?

21:35.440 --> 21:38.940
Why?!

23:12.300 --> 23:13.280
Komura Kaede here.

23:13.570 --> 23:15.120
I'm going to do the next episode preview.

23:15.530 --> 23:17.500
I have to keep it together this time.

23:17.500 --> 23:20.750
This is the Mie-san anime 
next episode preview.

23:21.630 --> 23:24.800
One day, Mie-san picks 
up a love letter, and...

23:24.800 --> 23:25.880
Mie-san!

23:25.880 --> 23:27.960
Why would you pick that up?!

23:27.960 --> 23:29.700
Did you forget your glasses again?

23:29.700 --> 23:32.140
A love letter? Whose?!

23:32.780 --> 23:36.470
N-Next episode: "The Girl I Like 
Picked Up A Love Letter"

23:33.340 --> 23:40.020
Episode 3

23:33.340 --> 23:40.020
The Girl I Like

23:33.340 --> 23:40.020
Picked Up A Love Letter

23:36.750 --> 23:38.270
See you then!
